# MISC-MH-08: exception X width rule; a 2-unit wire per cell with hints touching it from the left, right, above and below, straddling hints, an L-shaped hint and far hints (Q-MISC-13); drc listall why and count.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/t -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load H0
box 0 0 20 2
paint m1
select top cell
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc listall count
load He
box 0 0 20 2
paint m1
property MASKHINTS_X -10 -10 30 10
select top cell
drc check
drc catchup
